Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:00:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] FXL-3: Generate FIX 4.2 and 4.4 dictionaries from Orchestra
 files

- Created tools/build-dictionary.mjs to parse Orchestra XML files
- Extracts fields and code sets, generates deterministic JSON output
- Created src/dictionary.js with lookup() and enumName() functions
- Generated src/dictionary/FIX42.json and FIX44.json
- Copied LICENSE and created SOURCE.md with commit hash
- Added comprehensive test suite with 17 tests covering all ACs
- All tests pass
